  "notes": "Custom canonical v4 bankroll game. Ordinary swaps support all four modes; wagered swaps are exact-input only through the bound router. The inclusive fee is 1000 pips (10 bps) of executed gross native-ETH quote, entirely allocated to the immutable Programmable recipient. Chainlink VRF v2.5 uses native-ETH direct funding. The source package is a proposal generated under submission standard 1.5.0; the current 1.6.0 local preflight reports schema/channel drift and does not imply readiness. A fresh clean clone passed 76 tests, build, size, launch-specification, format and lint checks; the RPC-dependent fork test was not rerun. This request is for review only."
